notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T13:27:54.998Z","harness:codex","Fresh npm ci resolved @unbrained/pm-cli, pm-changelog, and pm-ops 2026.8.7 with zero install vulnerabilities. Full release:check passed: typecheck/build, five-file 38-declaration docstrings, 23 behavioral tests, exact configured 100/100/100 for index.ts and series.ts, real two-branch metric merge, 10,000-event bounded-history evidence, production audit, package dry-run, and changelog. pm validate passed with only two pre-existing closed-item resolution warnings; strict read-only pm health passed with no warnings. Audit boundaries are explicit: scripts/coverage-gate.ts, docstring-gate.ts, and prepare-merge-driver.ts are outside instrumentation; no lint/duplication or raw-object identity gate exists; reachable history contains two non-noreply identities. pm-rl-zcqf tracks these release blockers, so no publication is attempted."
